.TH EBPF\-EXPORTER 1 "2026-10-29" "unheaded 158367ea" "Unheaded Kingdom"
.SH NAME
ebpf\-exporter \- Export Shield and Monad eBPF ring buffers and maps as Prometheus metrics.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ebpf\-exporter
[\fIOPTION\fR]...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Export Shield and Monad eBPF ring buffers and maps as Prometheus metrics.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-bpf\-path \fISTRING\fR
BPF object files directory (default /opt/unheaded/ebpf)
.TP
.B \-\-interval \fIDURATION\fR
BPF map polling interval (default 1s)
.TP
.B \-\-log\-level \fISTRING\fR
Log level: debug|info|warn|error (default info)
.TP
.B \-\-port \fIN\fR
HTTP metrics port (default 9435)
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
display this help and exit
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
output version information and exit
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
ebpf\-exporter \-\-port 9435 \-\-bpf\-path /sys/fs/bpf/unheaded
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR unheaded (1)
